Overview
Mastercard is revising the Mastercard Move - MoneySend and Funding
Transactions Program Standards - Geographic Availability of Service
Addendum.
Effective date details
Date Details
16 June 2026 Revised Standards become effective.
Customer benefit
Customers participating in the Mastercard Move – MoneySend and
Funding Transactions Program will benefit from the expanded list of
available countries and additional types of transactions.
What Mastercard is doing
Mastercard is expanding the list of additional types of transactions in
Latin America and the Caribbean, Europe, and Middle East/Africa
regions for the Mastercard Move – MoneySend and Funding Transactions
Program Standards – Geographic Availability of Service Addendum.
NOTE: The changes to the Mastercard Move – MoneySend and Funding
Transactions Program Standards – Geographic Availability of Service
Addendum detailed in this bulletin announcement are effective as of
the date of publication of this announcement.
