Overview of revised Standards
Mastercard will update the Mastercard Move – MoneySend and Funding Transactions Program Standards –
Geographic Availability of Service Addendum to reflect the changes detailed in this bulletin announcement.
Mastercard will update the Mastercard Move – MoneySend and Funding Transactions Program Standards –
Geographic Availability of Service Addendum to modify the countries in which Mastercard will make the
MoneySend and Funding Transactions Program available:
• Chapter 2 Geographic availability of Service
– Section 2.3 Europe Region
– Section 2.3.1 Geographic availability for Europe Region
– Section 2.4. Latin America and the Caribbean Region
– Section 2.4.1 Geographic availability for Latin America and the Caribbean Region
– Section 2.5 Middle East/Africa Region
– Section 2.5.1 Geographic availability for Middle East/Africa Region
– Section 2.7 Geographic Availability of Additional Types of Transactions
– Section 2.7.1 MoneySend Payment Transactions involving funds from the sale of Cryptocurrency
– Section 2.7.2 Funding Transaction into a Cryptocurrency Account
– Section 2.7.3 Funding Transaction into a Gaming or Gambling Account
– Section 2.7.5 Cash-In at ATM – Payment Transaction
– Section 2.7.6 Cash-In at Point of Sale (POS) - Payment Transactions
– Section 2.7.13 Gaming Payment Transaction
